<title>SWITZERLAND: Italy launches one bln Swiss franc seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>Italy launches one bln Swiss franc seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's one billion Swiss franc seven-year bond been launched with a 3-1/4 percent coupon, priced at 102.25, according to lead manager CSFB.</p>
<p>The bond matures on July 1, 2004.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>Italy said earlier on Tuesday that it was planning such an issue, according to a statement released by the the Italian Treasury.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
